According to a spoiler file, tameness is:

"Decreased by 1 point for every 150 moves spent on a different level
from the hero. (In Slash'EM, only werecreatures, mindless creatures,
undead, demons and animals will go feral when abandoned.) If this
decreases tameness to zero or less, the pet is no longer tame and may
be hostile. Also, if the pet would have starved to death while away
from the hero, it becomes hostile instead."



